enova","title":"Senior Director, Programmatic Media Sales & Marketing, Canada","co":"Inuvo","li":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/victorgenova/","past":"Blue Ant Media, from Digital Account Executive to Manager of Digital Sales, Partnerships and Ad Operations (2019 Havas Media Canada Digital Rep of the Year). Sales roles at Connected Interactive and Rogers Media. Co-chaired AdClub of Toronto's Digital Day from 2017 to 2019.","edu":"University of Stirling, MSc Media Management; Brock University, Bachelor of Sport Management","about":"16+ years in digital media, programmatic advertising and ad tech sales leadership. He launched Inuvo's AI-driven advertising business in Canada from the ground up. Since 2015 he has hosted, edited and produced the Media People Podcast about the people behind media and advertising, and he sits on the CMA AdTech Committee.","qs":["You launched Inuvo in Canada from zero. What does building a business from the ground up look like in the first year?","Your podcast has run for more than ten years. How has it helped your career, and should students start their own?","In simple terms, how is AI changing how ads get targeted, especially as browsers block tracking?","What does a good ad sales rep do that a weak one doesn't?","You studied sport management. How did you end up in ad tech sales?"]},{"g":"m","name":"Bobby Tiet","title":"Senior Manager, Publisher Partnerships","co":"StackAdapt","li":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/bobbytiet/","past":"8+ years at StackAdapt, from Account Executive to Senior Account Executive to Account Director in Los Angeles, where he was the top individual contributor by revenue from 2021 to 2024. Earlier: account manager for mobile advertising at Go2mobi and digital operations at YTZ International. He also produced short films, including Crazy8s finalist Astronaut.","edu":"Not listed on LinkedIn","about":"Leads publisher partnerships and product strategy for audio across North America (podcasts, streaming music, radio) and a